{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Test {\n    int readInt() {\n        int ans = 0;\n        boolean neg = false;\n        try {\n            boolean start = false;\n            for (int c = 0; (c = System.in.read()) != -1; ) {\n                if (c == '-') {\n                    start = true;\n                    neg = true;\n                    continue;\n                } else if (c >= '0' && c <= '9') {\n                    start = true;\n                    ans = ans * 10 + c - '0';\n                } else if (start) break;\n            }\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n        }\n        return neg ? -ans : ans;\n    }\n\n    int r, c;\n    Scanner sca = new Scanner(System.in);\n    long[][] C = new long[64][64];\n    long best = Long.MAX_VALUE;\n\n    void dfs(long x, long y, int v1, int v2) {\n        long d = Math.abs(x - y);\n        if (best <= 1 || d - C[v1][r]*C[v2][r] >= best) return;\n        if (v1 == 0 && v2 == 0) {\n            if (d < best) best = d;\n            return;\n        }\n        if (v1 > 0) {\n            long c1 = C[v1][r] - C[v1-1][r], s2 = C[v2][r];\n            dfs(x, y + c1*s2, v1 - 1, v2);\n        }\n        if (v2 > 0) {\n            long s1 = C[v1][r], c2 = C[v2][r] - C[v2-1][r];\n            dfs(x + s1*c2, y, v1, v2 - 1);\n        }\n    }\n\n    int[] cntA = new int[64], cntB = new int[64];\n    Map<Long, Long> cache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();\n    char[] cs;\n\n    long solve(long x, long y, int v1, int v2) {\n        long k = x*10000 + v1*100  + v2;\n        Long v = cache.get(k);\n        if (v != null) return v;\n        v = 0L;\n        long d = Math.abs(x - y);\n        if (d - C[v1][r]*C[v2][r] > best) {\n            cache.put(k, v);\n            return v;\n        }\n        if (v1 == 0 && v2 == 0) return 1L;\n        char c = cs[v1 + v2 - 1];\n        if (v1 > 0 && c != 'B') {\n            long c1 = C[v1][r] - C[v1 - 1][r], s2 = C[v2][r];\n            v += solve(x, y + c1*s2, v1 - 1, v2);\n        }\n        if (v2 > 0 && c != 'A') {\n            long s1 = C[v1][r], c2 = C[v2][r] - C[v2-1][r];\n            v += solve( x + s1*c2, y, v1, v2 - 1);\n        }\n        cache.put(k, v);\n        return v;\n    }\n\n    void start() {\n        r = sca.nextInt(); c = sca.nextInt(); sca.nextLine();\n        cs = sca.nextLine().toCharArray();\n        for (int i = 0; i <= 2*(r + c); i++)\n            for (int j = 0; j <= 2*(r + c); j++) {\n                if (j == 0) C[i][j] = 1;\n                else if (i == 0) C[i][j] = 0;\n                else C[i][j] = C[i-1][j - 1] + C[i - 1][j];\n            }\n        int v1 = r + c, v2 = r + c;\n        long x = 0, y = 0;\n        while (v1 >= r && v2 >= r) {\n            if (x > y) {\n                long c1 = C[v1][r] - C[v1 - 1][r], s2 = C[v2][r];\n                y += c1*s2;\n                v1--;\n            } else {\n                long s1 = C[v1][r], c2 = C[v2][r] - C[v2-1][r];\n                x += s1*c2;\n                v2--;\n            }\n        }\n        best = Math.abs(x - y);\n        dfs(0, 0, r + c, r + c);\n        for (int i = 0; i < 2*(r+c); i++) {\n            cntA[i + 1] = cntA[i] + (cs[i] == 'A' ? 1 : 0);\n            cntB[i + 1] = cntB[i] + (cs[i] == 'B' ? 1 : 0);\n        }\n        long ans = solve(0, 0, r + c, r + c);\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new Test().start();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nfrom functools import lru_cache\n\nclass Test:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.r = 0\n        self.c = 0\n        self.cs = []\n        self.C = [[0] * 64 for _ in range(64)]\n        self.best = float('inf')\n        self.cntA = [0] * 64\n        self.cntB = [0] * 64\n        self.cache = {}\n\n    def readInt(self):\n        ans = 0\n        neg = False\n        try:\n            start = False\n            while True:\n                c = sys.stdin.read(1)\n                if not c:\n                    break\n                c = ord(c)\n                if c == ord('-'):\n                    start = True\n                    neg = True\n                    continue\n                elif ord('0') <= c <= ord('9'):\n                    start = True\n                    ans = ans * 10 + c - ord('0')\n                elif start:\n                    break\n        except:\n            pass\n        return -ans if neg else ans\n\n    def dfs(self, x, y, v1, v2):\n        d = abs(x - y)\n        if self.best <= 1 or d - self.C[v1][self.r] * self.C[v2][self.r] >= self.best:\n            return\n        if v1 == 0 and v2 == 0:\n            if d < self.best:\n                self.best = d\n            return\n        if v1 > 0:\n            c1 = self.C[v1][self.r] - self.C[v1-1][self.r]\n            s2 = self.C[v2][self.r]\n            self.dfs(x, y + c1 * s2, v1 - 1, v2)\n        if v2 > 0:\n            s1 = self.C[v1][self.r]\n            c2 = self.C[v2][self.r] - self.C[v2-1][self.r]\n            self.dfs(x + s1 * c2, y, v1, v2 - 1)\n\n    @lru_cache(maxsize=None)\n    def solve(self, x, y, v1, v2):\n        k = (x, v1, v2)\n        if k in self.cache:\n            return self.cache[k]\n        \n        v = 0\n        d = abs(x - y)\n        if d - self.C[v1][self.r] * self.C[v2][self.r] > self.best:\n            self.cache[k] = v\n            return v\n        \n        if v1 == 0 and v2 == 0:\n            return 1\n        \n        c = self.cs[v1 + v2 - 1]\n        if v1 > 0 and c != 'B':\n            c1 = self.C[v1][self.r] - self.C[v1-1][self.r]\n            s2 = self.C[v2][self.r]\n            v += self.solve(x, y + c1 * s2, v1 - 1, v2)\n        if v2 > 0 and c != 'A':\n            s1 = self.C[v1][self.r]\n            c2 = self.C[v2][self.r] - self.C[v2-1][self.r]\n            v += self.solve(x + s1 * c2, y, v1, v2 - 1)\n        \n        self.cache[k] = v\n        return v\n\n    def start(self):\n        # Read r and c\n        line = sys.stdin.readline().strip().split()\n        self.r = int(line[0])\n        self.c = int(line[1])\n        \n        # Read the character string\n        self.cs = list(sys.stdin.readline().strip())\n        \n        # Precompute binomial coefficients\n        for i in range(2 * (self.r + self.c) + 1):\n            for j in range(2 * (self.r + self.c) + 1):\n                if j == 0:\n                    self.C[i][j] = 1\n                elif i == 0:\n                    self.C[i][j] = 0\n                else:\n                    self.C[i][j] = self.C[i-1][j-1] + self.C[i-1][j]\n        \n        v1 = self.r + self.c\n        v2 = self.r + self.c\n        x = 0\n        y = 0\n        \n        while v1 >= self.r and v2 >= self.r:\n            if x > y:\n                c1 = self.C[v1][self.r] - self.C[v1-1][self.r]\n                s2 = self.C[v2][self.r]\n                y += c1 * s2\n                v1 -= 1\n            else:\n                s1 = self.C[v1][self.r]\n                c2 = self.C[v2][self.r] - self.C[v2-1][self.r]\n                x += s1 * c2\n                v2 -= 1\n        \n        self.best = abs(x - y)\n        self.dfs(0, 0, self.r + self.c, self.r + self.c)\n        \n        # Precompute prefix counts\n        for i in range(2 * (self.r + self.c)):\n            self.cntA[i + 1] = self.cntA[i] + (1 if self.cs[i] == 'A' else 0)\n            self.cntB[i + 1] = self.cntB[i] + (1 if self.cs[i] == 'B' else 0)\n        \n        ans = self.solve(0, 0, self.r + self.c, self.r + self.c)\n        print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    test = Test()\n    test.start()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-5.113947918289341e-05, -5.960462772236497e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.0006579380133189261, -0.12755921483039856, -0.00523553229868412, -0.12696710228919983, -0.05131541192531586, -2.90866428258596e-05, -3.397406908334233e-05, -0.00013147920253686607, -4.8636207793606445e-05, -0.11283991485834122, -0.281507670879364, -8.11782301752828e-05, -1.2278481335670222e-05, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -2.729855441430118e-05, -0.5761551856994629, -0.0001995364436879754, -4.768370445162873e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, -5.364403477869928e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.00018153927521780133, -0.005304547492414713, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.814689989667386e-06, -3.099436753473128e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -1.311301275563892e-06, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -0.4748058319091797, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -0.016618747264146805, -4.410734163684538e-06, -0.00038521020906046033, -0.000832449528388679, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.00017069313616957515, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.06402032822370529, -9.536738616588991e-07, -2.1457441107486375e-05, -0.015644675120711327, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -9.53